<title>USA: Investor has 6.13 pct of Paul Mueller.</title>
<headline>Investor has 6.13 pct of Paul Mueller.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kansas City, Mo., doctor David Moore, his wife Mary Kathleen and a family investment partnership said Wednesday they have acquired 71,588 shares of Paul Mueller Co., or 6.13 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Moore group said it bought the stake for estate planning purposes.</p>
